<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) & Erlich et al. (2016) mollusc shell marginal buckling and antimarginal rib morphogenesis (Pecten jacobaeus (Mediterranean scallop / Bivalvia, Ammonitida & Brachiopoda))",
        "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) & Erlich et al. (2016) mollusc shell marginal buckling and antimarginal rib morphogenesis faithfully reproduces Pecten jacobaeus (Mediterranean scallop / Bivalvia, Ammonitida & Brachiopoda) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2013-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Pecten jacobaeus (Mediterranean scallop / Bivalvia, Ammonitida & Brachiopoda) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 49.2/100, audit 2026-10-19-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2013-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling.py> ;
    schema:about "Pecten jacobaeus (Mediterranean scallop / Bivalvia, Ammonitida & Brachiopoda)" ;
