<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) & Erlich et al. (2016) mollusc shell marginal buckling and antimarginal rib morphogenesis — Code-to-model traceability: 62/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module docstring cites Chirat et al. (2013), but functions lack explicit equation mappings to Erlich et al. (2016) and the 4 Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_072_mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2013-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling.py L28–L78: Functions lack explicit paper equation and Lean 4 theorem cross-references <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2013-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling.py#L28-L78>" ;
    pk:hasScore 6.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) & Erlich et al. (2016) mollusc shell marginal buckling and antimarginal rib morphogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 58/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Solves a 1D periodic Fourier relaxation of E*I*w_ssss + P*w_ss + k*w + kappa_3*w^3 = 0 at a single fixed arc length (L28-78), but lacks L-BFGS-B energy minimization of the exact Winkler-beam functional, omits the analytical supercritical pitchfork law A_eq(P) = sqrt(4*q_c^2*(P-P_c)/(3*kappa_3)), omits 3D accretionary shell surface deposition across isometric vs intercalating growth regimes, and lacks a subcritical negative control (P/P_c = 0.65 < 1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2013-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling.py L28–L78: Single-stage 1D Fourier relaxation without L-BFGS-B energy minimization, 3D accretionary shell surface, or subcritical negative control <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2013-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling.py#L28-L78>" ;
    pk:hasScore 5.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

