<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) & Erlich et al. (2016) mollusc shell marginal buckling and antimarginal rib morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 49.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2013-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling.py` (consensus score 53.1/100). The v1 script integrates the 1D fourth-order Winkler-beam mantle-margin PDE at a single adult scallop margin (L=122.87 mm, P/P_c=1.45), but omits 3D accretionary shell surface morphogenesis, isometric vs intercalating ontogenetic rib scaling, supercritical pitchfork bifurcation sweeps across P/P_c, subcritical negative controls (P < P_c), 12-species cross-taxa scaling collapse, and computer-vision polar segmentation of the vendored *Pecten jacobaeus* specimen. Overall 49.2/100 (faithfulness 42.3, reproducibility 65.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 24, Parameter expressivity 45, Morphometric validation 50, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 62, Reproducibility package 69. Output judged: docs/media/mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling_comparison.png: rendered output of 2013-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling.py at HEAD, image/png, 120133 B, 1430×572 px, artifact_sha256 ea04f8c7bdce3d6ca6d8d2a612a004dc24d0533c1cee4adc2e3f862ca2bc7047 (sha256 ea04f8c7bdce3d6ca6d8d2a612a004dc24d0533c1cee4adc2e3f862ca2bc7047), spec_fingerprint 890d42a5978673be401f72aa812cb4358400a79d2ca684773dc085cd5735c833. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 890d42a5978673be401f72aa812cb4358400a79d2ca684773dc085cd5735c833; artifact_sha256: ea04f8c7bdce3d6ca6d8d2a612a004dc24d0533c1cee4adc2e3f862ca2bc7047; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling/mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling_reference.json=dec7d148f176932a..., datasets/mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling/ribbed_bivalve_shell_specimen.jpg=a0ac69e8a9be3928..., datasets/mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling/scout_manifest.json=2fb38cc60b112598...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Expose full CLI parameter overrides (`--EI`, `--k`, `--P-ratio`, `--R-adult`, `--seed`, `--skip-gif`), upgrade `self_test()` to an 8-point verification suite with bitwise two-run determinism, and render a 6-panel publication-grade synthesis figure and co-evolving 3D accretionary growth GIF.",
        "remediation needed: Implement exact L-BFGS-B energy minimization of the fourth-order nonlinear Winkler-beam mantle energy functional U[w] = integral [0.5*EI*w_ss^2 - 0.5*P*w_s^2 + 0.5*k*w^2 + 0.25*kappa_3*w^4] ds alongside the analytical supercritical pitchfork amplitude law A_eq(P) = sqrt(4*q_c^2*(P-P_c)/(3*kappa_3)) and a subcritical negative control (P/P_c = 0.65 < 1 -> 0 ribs, RMS amplitude = 0).",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling/` at runtime, validate the universal quarter-power rib wavelength scaling law lambda_c = 2*pi*(E*I/k)^(1/4) and rib-number law across 12 empirical bivalve, gastropod, ammonite, and brachiopod species, and perform polar ray-averaged computer-vision segmentation of the 14 primary radial costae and linear wavelength expansion lambda(R) = R*dtheta on the *Pecten jacobaeus* specimen (`ribbed_bivalve_shell_specimen.jpg`).",
        "remediation needed: Simulate 3D accretionary shell valve morphogenesis across ontogeny (R = 12 -> 55 mm) for all 4 Chirat-Erlich morphospace regimes: (1) subcritical smooth valve, (2) isometric constant-rib-count *Pecten jacobaeus* (N_ribs = 14), (3) constant-wavelength secondary rib-intercalating multicostate shell (*Chlamys* / *Spirifer*, N_ribs: 6 -> 27.5), and (4) episodic orthomarginal + antimarginal cancellate/spiny varix flaring." ;
    pk:hasScore 4.92e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
